{"seq":1,"slug":"ios-deep-linking-implementation","title":"iOS 深链实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/implementation/ios-deep-linking-implementation","wordCount":705,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"ios-深链实现\">iOS 深链实现</h1><p>iOS 深链的处理入口随着 UIKit 到 SwiftUI 的演进而变化，但核心机制始终相同：系统将 URL 或 NSUserActivity 传递给 App，App 解析并导航到目标页面。本文完整覆盖从 AppDelegate、SceneDelegate 到 SwiftUI 的三代处理方式，以及背后的生命周期管理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>双入口机制</strong>：自定义 URI Scheme 通过 <code>application:open:options:</code> 传递 <code>URL</code>，Universal Links 通过 <code>application:continue:restorationHandler:</code> 传递 <code>NSUserActivity</code>，两者必须分别处理</li>\n<li><strong>SceneDelegate 的优先级</strong>：iOS 13+ 的多窗口 App 中，URL 处理已移到 <code>UIWindowSceneDelegate</code>，<code>AppDelegate</code> 中的旧方法不再被调用，需要同时实现两套代码以兼容旧版 iOS</li>\n<li><strong>冷启动与热启动</strong>：App 从未运行状态打开深链时，<code>willConnectTo:options:</code> 先于 UI 就绪执行，需要将深链暂存为 <code>pendingDeepLink</code>，在 UI 完成初始化后再处理</li>\n<li><strong>SwiftUI <code>onOpenURL</code></strong>：SwiftUI 4.0 之后的统一处理入口，替代了 AppDelegate 和 SceneDelegate 的分散处理，但仍需在 <code>App</code> 结构体的根级 Scene 上添加修饰符</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"ios-深链的两条入口\">iOS 深链的两条入口</h2><p>iOS 上的深链通过两种不同的系统机制传递：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>传递给 App 的数据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自定义 URI Scheme（<code>myapp://</code>）</td>\n<td>URL open</td>\n<td><code>URL</code> 对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Universal Links（<code>https://</code>）</td>\n<td>NSUserActivity</td>\n<td><code>NSUserActivity</code>（含 <code>webpageURL</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[点击 myapp://...] --&gt; B[UIApplicationDelegate.application:open:options]&#10;    C[点击 https://...] --&gt; D[UIApplicationDelegate.application:continue:restorationHandler]&#10;    B --&gt; E[路由解析]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[导航到目标页]\">graph LR\n    A[点击 myapp://...] --&gt; B[UIApplicationDelegate.application:open:options]\n    C[点击 https://...] --&gt; D[UIApplicationDelegate.application:continue:restorationHandler]\n    B --&gt; E[路由解析]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[导航到目标页]</pre><h2 id=\"appdelegate-方式-ios-12-及以前\">AppDelegate 方式（iOS 12 及以前）</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"@UIApplicationMain&#10;class AppDelegate: UIResponder, UIApplicationDelegate {&#10;&#10;    // 处理自定义 URI Scheme&#10;    func application(_ app: UIApplication,&#10;                     open url: URL,&#10;                     options: [UIApplication.OpenURLOptionsKey: Any] = [:]) -&gt; Bool {&#10;        return DeepLinkRouter.shared.handle(url: url)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 处理 Universal Links（NSUserActivity）&#10;    func application(_ application: UIApplication,&#10;                     continue userActivity: NSUserActivity,&#10;                     restorationHandler: @escaping ([UIUserActivityRestoring]?) -&gt; Void) -&gt; Bool {&#10;        guard userActivity.activityType == NSUserActivityTypeBrowsingWeb,&#10;              let url = userActivity.webpageURL else {&#10;            return false&#10;        }&#10;        return DeepLinkRouter.shared.handle(url: url)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@UIApplicationMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AppDelegate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">UIResponder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">UIApplicationDelegate </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 处理自定义 URI Scheme</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> application</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> app: UIApplication,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                     open</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> url: URL,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                     options</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [UIApplication.OpenURLOptionsKey: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DeepLinkRouter.shared.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">handle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: url)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 处理 Universal Links（NSUserActivity）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> application</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> application: UIApplication,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                     continue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userActivity: NSUserActivity,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                     restorationHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@escaping</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ([UIUserActivityRestoring]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        guard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userActivity.activityType </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NSUserActivityTypeBrowsingWeb,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">              let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> url </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userActivity.webpageURL </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DeepLinkRouter.shared.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">handle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: url)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意：当 App 从未运行状态被 URL 唤醒时，<code>open url</code> 方法在 <code>didFinishLaunchingWithOptions</code> 之后调用，Launch Options 中包含 <code>UIApplication.LaunchOptionsKey.url</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"func application(_ application: UIApplication,&#10;                 didFinishLaunchingWithOptions launchOptions: [UIApplication.LaunchOptionsKey: Any]?) -&gt; Bool {&#10;    // App 从未运行状态被 URL 唤起时处理&#10;    if let url = launchOptions?[.url] as? URL {&#10;        // 此时 UI 可能尚未就绪，需要延迟处理&#10;        pendingDeepLink = url&#10;    }&#10;    return true&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> application</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> application: UIApplication,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                 didFinishLaunchingWithOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> launchOptions: [UIApplication.LaunchOptionsKey: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // App 从未运行状态被 URL 唤起时处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> url </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> launchOptions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> URL {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 此时 UI 可能尚未就绪，需要延迟处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        pendingDeepLink </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> url</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"scenedelegate-方式-ios-13\">SceneDelegate 方式（iOS 13+）</h2><p>iOS 13 引入多窗口架构后，URL 处理移到 SceneDelegate：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"class SceneDelegate: UIResponder, UIWindowSceneDelegate {&#10;    var window: UIWindow?&#10;&#10;    // App 冷启动（从不运行状态打开链接）&#10;    func scene(_ scene: UIScene,&#10;               willConnectTo session: UISceneSession,&#10;               options connectionOptions: UIScene.ConnectionOptions) {&#10;        // 处理 Universal Links&#10;        if let userActivity = connectionOptions.userActivities.first(&#10;            where: { $0.activityType == NSUserActivityTypeBrowsingWeb }),&#10;           let url = userActivity.webpageURL {&#10;            pendingDeepLink = url&#10;        }&#10;        // 处理自定义 URI Scheme&#10;        if let urlContext = connectionOptions.urlContexts.first {&#10;            pendingDeepLink = urlContext.url&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // App 已在后台，被 URI Scheme 唤起&#10;    func scene(_ scene: UIScene, openURLContexts URLContexts: Set&lt;UIOpenURLContext&gt;) {&#10;        guard let url = URLContexts.first?.url else { return }&#10;        DeepLinkRouter.shared.handle(url: url)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // App 已在后台，被 Universal Links 唤起&#10;    func scene(_ scene: UIScene, continue userActivity: NSUserActivity) {&#10;        guard let url = userActivity.webpageURL else { return }&#10;        DeepLinkRouter.shared.handle(url: url)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-ligh