F\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: c[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        case</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">where</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"user\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">userProfile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: c[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        default:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"生命周期与导航时序\">生命周期与导航时序</h2><p>深链处理最常见的问题是时序：收到深链时，目标页面所需的数据（如登录状态）可能尚未就绪。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant System as iOS 系统&#10;    participant App as App&#10;    participant Auth as 登录状态&#10;    participant Nav as 导航器&#10;&#10;    System-&gt;&gt;App: 传递深链 URL&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;App: 存储 pendingDeepLink&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;Auth: 等待登录状态初始化&#10;    Auth-&gt;&gt;App: 已登录 / 未登录&#10;    alt 已登录&#10;        App-&gt;&gt;Nav: 导航到目标页面&#10;    else 未登录&#10;        App-&gt;&gt;Nav: 跳到登录页,保留 pendingDeepLink&#10;        Nav-&gt;&gt;App: 登录成功后&#10;        App-&gt;&gt;Nav: 处理 pendingDeepLink&#10;    end\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant System as iOS 系统\n    participant App as App\n    participant Auth as 登录状态\n    participant Nav as 导航器\n\n    System-&gt;&gt;App: 传递深链 URL\n    App-&gt;&gt;App: 存储 pendingDeepLink\n    App-&gt;&gt;Auth: 等待登录状态初始化\n    Auth-&gt;&gt;App: 已登录 / 未登录\n    alt 已登录\n        App-&gt;&gt;Nav: 导航到目标页面\n    else 未登录\n        App-&gt;&gt;Nav: 跳到登录页,保留 pendingDeepLink\n        Nav-&gt;&gt;App: 登录成功后\n        App-&gt;&gt;Nav: 处理 pendingDeepLink\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>iOS 深链实现的关键检查清单：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>兼容性覆盖</strong>：同时实现 AppDelegate（iOS 12 及以下）和 SceneDelegate（iOS 13+）两套回调，或在 <code>Info.plist</code> 中配置 Scene manifest 并只实现 SceneDelegate</li>\n<li><strong>冷热启动均测试</strong>：从未运行状态（冷启动）和 App 在后台（热启动）的深链处理路径不同，必须分别测试</li>\n<li><strong>导航时序保护</strong>：使用 <code>pendingDeepLink</code> 模式处理 UI 初始化延迟，在登录态就绪后才执行导航</li>\n<li><strong>路由解析类型安全</strong>：用枚举 <code>DeepLinkDestination</code> 而非字符串标识导航目标，编译期防止路由错误</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>本章相关文档：</strong> <a href=\"android-deep-linking-implementation\">Android 深链实现</a> 覆盖 Android 侧的 Intent 处理和 Jetpack 导航；<a href=\"web-to-app-routing\">Web-to-App 路由</a> 介绍从网页发起跳转的处理策略。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"iOS 深链实现","id":"ios-深链实现"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"iOS 深链的两条入口","id":"ios-深链的两条入口"},{"level":2,"text":"AppDelegate 方式（iOS 12 及以前）","id":"appdelegate-方式-ios-12-及以前"},{"level":2,"text":"SceneDelegate 方式（iOS 13+）","id":"scenedelegate-方式-ios-13"},{"level":2,"text":"SwiftUI 方式","id":"swiftui-方式"},{"level":3,"text":"SwiftUI NavigationStack 与深链整合","id":"swiftui-navigationstack-与深链整合"},{"level":2,"text":"路由解析器的设计","id":"路由解析器的设计"},{"level":2,"text":"生命周期与导航时序","id":"生命周期与导航时序"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"剪贴板与粘贴检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/deferred/clipboard-paste-detection"},"next":{"title":"Android 深链实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/implementation/android-deep-linking-implementation"}}